OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAndy and Julian host at the swanky
OL,7,     FPlas Dinas Country House in Eryri
OL,8,     F(Snowdonia), where they've
OL,9,     Fallocated their guests the
OL,10,     Fpriciest rooms.
OL,11,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe final visit is to Annette's
OL,13,     FHazelwood Farm in Crake,
OL,14,     FYorkshire, where she's lined up
OL,15,     Fher idea of fun for her guests: a
OL,16,     Fcycling tour. But not everyone is
OL,17,     Fup for it...
